  "step_3": "The decision reason requires consideration of differences between outcomes and a reference value (zero here), and a comparison of the mean of those differences weighted by probabilities. The individual did not mention the reference value, nor did they compute or reference differences from zero. Instead, the justification is based on a qualitative assessment of higher prize and lower probability, without any reference to mean differences or a formal rule involving deviations from a baseline. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason as described. The reasoning is inconsistent with the structure of the decision reason. The score is low because the reported deliberation process lacks the key elements of the reason.",
